# CCM Weil-form τ-matrix disk cache.
#
# The toolkit writes τ fixtures here as `<cwd>/data/tau_cache/` when a
# run computes (or remote-fetches) a τ-matrix. The generated
# `.json` / `.json.zip` / `.json.zip.partXX` files are gitignored (see
# /.gitignore); this `.gitkeep` keeps the directory structure in the
# repo so the layout is self-documenting and present on a fresh clone.
#
# Public consolidated fixtures live at:
#   https://github.com/TeamXcelerator/xcelerator-tau-cache
